  "description": "Optional Bogus integration for AutoPoco. Adds data sources for realistic names, companies, addresses, phone numbers, product names and prices, driven by the AutoPoco session seed. AutoPoco keeps building the object graph, Bogus only supplies the individual values.",
  "id": "holonsoft.AutoPoco.Faker",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-22T08:06:43.08Z",
