  "published": "2026-09-22T08:01:59.133Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.Faker.md",
  "releaseNotes": "6.1: First release. Data sources backed by Bogus for first, last and full names, company names, email addresses, phone numbers, street addresses, cities, countries, postal codes, product names, prices, currency codes and dates, each with a nullable variant and a configurable locale. The AutoPoco session seed drives Bogus through a Randomizer that runs on AutoPoco's own StableRandom, so a seed produces the same values on every .NET version. The Bogus version is pinned exactly, because its locale data decides the values for a seed.",
